{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2013-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1375315200, "end_date": 1377993599, "month_true_total": 16, "quota": 16, "returned": 16, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:47:59 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "2955421", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015061944", "personaname": "SpicyBoi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jouri148/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 775, "last_played": 1375973765, "avatar": "e684a4bb12c794783c0f51ae1ba83c49bdb052fa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good single player campaign with both hack and slash and FPS elements. Worth a play through. Decent multiplayer.", "timestamp_created": 1377985598, "timestamp_updated": 1377985598, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2742261", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011947916", "personaname": "[DFC] Takadekadaka ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Takadekadaka/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1692, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1450, "last_played": 1402900258, "avatar": "1ba09ced9c5f545d95cc2204c3293919d720bc68"}, "language": "english", "review": "For anyone who loves a good shooter game, this is the game for you, especially if you are a WarHammer 40k fan. The campaign is very fun and the story is entertaining for both those who are versed in Warhammer 40k lore and those are not. On the multiplayer side, the 3 classes provide the player many different ways to play and is very fun.", "timestamp_created": 1377730731, "timestamp_updated": 1377730731, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3299646", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020414391", "personaname": "[DeathWing] Azyria 1st Legion", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/XxAzyAzyXx/", "num_games_owned": 191, "num_reviews": 67, "playtime_forever": 82055, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 68454, "last_played": 1749235306, "avatar": "846605b616bdd2453d92eb3999b0d6d858c3c26c"}, "language": "english", "review": "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ – 5/5\n\"From Teen Years to Now – Space Marine Still Hits Hard\"\n\nWarhammer 40,000: Space Marine has been with me since my teen years, and after all this time, it still holds a special place in my heart. Back then, it was everything I wanted in a game—brutal action, larger-than-life characters, and the chance to step into the armor of an unstoppable Ultramarine. And now, years later, it still delivers.\n\nThe combat is as satisfying as ever—visceral, weighty, and unapologetically over-the-top. Chainsword revving, bolter blazing, smashing through hordes of Orks and Chaos Marines—it’s the kind of gameplay that never gets old. The blend of melee and ranged action struck a perfect balance that few games have managed to replicate.\n\nEven now, the atmosphere, the soundtrack, and the lore-packed world hit me with waves of nostalgia. But it’s more than just a trip down memory lane—Space Marine holds up as a genuinely great third-person action game. It captures the brutal glory of the 40k universe in a way that's both cinematic and intensely fun.\n\nFor me, Space Marine isn’t just a game—it’s a piece of my personal gaming history, and I’m beyond excited for the sequel. If you’ve never played it, don’t sleep on this one. And if you have? Fire it up again. It’s just as epic as you remember.", "timestamp_created": 1377703471, "timestamp_updated": 1748188476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6266959", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062505821", "personaname": "⛧P0WERS666⛧", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DEATHN0TE88/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2093, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1807, "last_played": 1685180842, "avatar": "209be9f30b9dc7795ccf90e734d32fd2dad2f0c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1377648582, "timestamp_updated": 1377648582, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "237972", "author": {"steamid": "76561197966264399", "personaname": "NATESOR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NATESOR/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 956, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 882, "last_played": 1416497436, "avatar": "95aab663c27e99908928ade945c4e883e6eaa120"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't expect a very deep or ground-breaking game in the story or gameplay departments.  Do expect ridiculous amounts of fun bringing glorious slaughter to hordes of orks and traitor scum in the name of the Emperor.  \n\n8.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1377394695, "timestamp_updated": 1377394695, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6023866", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057437777", "personaname": "Brother Ares((BT/LE))", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057437777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 47953, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 41131, "last_played": 1714848093, "avatar": "dadeccf5d32b0b9bb96c7c5737ea3c7dc33c14b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "bolter !!!\nchainswords!!!\ndead orks !!!\njust great !!!\n40k mayham !!!", "timestamp_created": 1377211347, "timestamp_updated": 1401973505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1621957", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995494660", "personaname": "Albanian_Stud", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yagmi305/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 2029, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1229, "last_played": 1458757378, "avatar": "6539c635572f296c53f385afc0c0a98626c42de1"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Codex Astartes is clear. Exterminate all Xenos with extreme prejudice. Space Marine is a Warhammer 40k fan's wet dream in so many ways. The trademark generic story, the glorious vestments, da BOYZ, and most importantly, incredible bloody combat. This game falls short in the story department flatter than a pancake, and the generic enemy types can get dull after a while, but the combat of this game and the joy of shoving your chainsword into an Ork's skull and watching it flay open is just too good to pass up. If this goes on sale, BUY IT.", "timestamp_created": 1377186047, "timestamp_updated": 1377186047, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1487322", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993703113", "personaname": "Hootie", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hootie00/", "num_games_owned": 1688, "num_reviews": 288, "playtime_forever": 1229, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 311, "last_played": 1661501875, "avatar": "e4e1aacf3e2442a1d600e858931f5527c8637e32"}, "language": "english", "review": "Meh", "timestamp_created": 1377162862, "timestamp_updated": 1771531586, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496240615844726562", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2550704", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009165214", "personaname": "Cobra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/slayerof100/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 10299, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3953, "last_played": 1780694647, "avatar": "3fec3c6a2220b76b3f957078cbc7c77b8eb7e937"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"Forget the promise of progress and understanding, \nfor in the grim dark future THERE IS ONLY WAR.\"\n\n\nI think this is the best game I've ever play in my ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ life!\nAlso, it got me addicted to the lore, BEST sci-fi story ever!\n\nThe only bad side: \nAltho can be repetitive, it will left you wanting for more. WHAT?\n\n\n♥♥♥♥ it! (10/10) - The Emperor Protects!\nC'mon relic, we need that damn sequel!", "timestamp_created": 1377066148, "timestamp_updated": 1510814388, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540636062622070312", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1769304", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997724945", "personaname": "Zorder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zorder/", "num_games_owned": 5431, "num_reviews": 178, "playtime_forever": 625, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 420, "last_played": 1430168682, "avatar": "fbe6685f14dcbd78c6a7f1bda063ede69908eda8"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is probably the thing that gives you the closest feel to feel like you're an actual Space Marine. I'm a HUGE Warhammer 40k fan and this was simply made to please me. Overall I'd say the game isn't really that big of a deal but if you're into 40k you're gonna love it. It's a standard third person corridor shooter with some collectibles scattered on the levels, other than that is just hack and slash and shooting your way through Orks and Chaos forces, it's AWESOME I know right? The story plot is rather interesting specially the ending and I highly recommend it to any Space Marine or Warhammer 40k fans out there, I assure you, you won't regret playing this!", "timestamp_created": 1377041878, "timestamp_updated": 1385410427, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.555233955383300781", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1398272", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992741710", "personaname": "Kuuhaku", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/darkegbf/", "num_games_owned": 454, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 1429, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1041, "last_played": 1727314727, "avatar": "86149f901ec929a7e12f98afb3d9923eb1823b04"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is criminally underrated, and one of the greatest \"didn't sell enough to warrant a sequel\" tragedies I can think of. Action games rarely go all out when it comes to the sheer number of enemies you fight, and simplistic-yet-satisfying gameplay is hard to pull off but Space Marine does both incredibly well. The multiplayer is solid for what was probably an afterthought, but the single player campaign is superbly entertaining and packed with violence in the WH40K style. \n\nIf only this game had Tyranids in it.", "timestamp_created": 1376878402, "timestamp_updated": 1385409473, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51628267765045166", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2294347", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005312663", "personaname": "Devizz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/devizz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 7110, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6655, "last_played": 1527605644, "avatar": "c58fc4ef4a7814bffcc147c9c64a6e15ea190ea0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Worth every penny, relic did an amazing job. Without a question,the best warhammer 40k fpp game out there. As for me, one of THE best fpp games ever made. Combat in this game is just SO darn GOOD! Very intuitive. All you want to do is smash and kill, being the ultimate badass that you are.", "timestamp_created": 1376769571, "timestamp_updated": 1599956825, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481530308723449707", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2860092", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013702696", "personaname": "Yarrick2k5", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yarrick2k5/", "num_games_owned": 273, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 6350, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4945, "last_played": 1450950080, "avatar": "c08a803bae23242481414571b12c5bfa5194703c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game, shame multiplayer community is pretty much desolate now", "timestamp_created": 1376165130, "timestamp_updated": 1376165130, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1115249", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987070734", "personaname": "Grove of Dreams", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197987070734/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 135, "playtime_forever": 2863, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1318, "last_played": 1384498947, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "FOR THE EMPEROR!", "timestamp_created": 1375889392, "timestamp_updated": 1375889392, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.465686261653900146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_f